# The context carries only what an install from source needs: the package and
# its metadata. Everything else is excluded by default rather than enumerated,
# because a denylist has to anticipate every stray file a working checkout
# accumulates, and the ones it misses ship silently.
*

!src
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE

# Generated directories inside the allowed source tree. The patterns are
# unanchored because a subproject several levels inside src/ runs an external
# tool in its own virtual environment, which alone is larger than everything
# tracked in this repository.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
